   "sec": 8,
   "text": "Every tradition I know has tried to describe this walk."
  },
  {
   "slug": "the-christian-calls-it",
   "t0": 453.937,
   "t1": 459.255,
   "say": 4.503,
   "need": 4.7,
   "sec": 8,
   "text": "The Christian calls it the narrow gate. The kingdom within."
  },
  {
   "slug": "the-buddhist-calls-it",
   "t0": 459.375,
   "t1": 464.692,
   "say": 4.503,
   "need": 4.7,
   "sec": 8,
   "text": "The Buddhist calls it waking up. The end of not-seeing."
  },
  {
   "slug": "the-muslim-calls-it",
   "t0": 464.812,
   "t1": 469.675,
   "say": 4.08,
   "need": 4.35,
   "sec": 8,
   "text": "The Muslim calls it the lifting of the veils."
  },
  {
   "slug": "the-hindu-says-thou",
   "t0": 469.795,
   "t1": 473.293,
   "say": 2.809,
   "need": 3.3,
   "sec": 8,
   "text": "The Hindu says, Thou art that."
  },
  {
   "slug": "the-jew-speaks-of",
   "t0": 473.413,
   "t1": 479.186,
   "say": 4.927,
   "need": 5.05,
   "sec": 8,
   "text": "The Jew speaks of gathering the sparks from the broken vessels."
  },
  {
   "slug": "many-indigenous-peoples-call",
   "t0": 479.306,
   "t1": 484.623,
   "say": 4.503,
   "need": 4.7,
   "sec": 8,
   "text": "Many Indigenous peoples call it the remembering. The original instruction."
  },
  {
   "slug": "the-taoist-says-that",
   "t0": 484.743,
   "t1": 490.97,
   "say": 5.351,
   "need": 5.4,
   "sec": 8,
   "text": "The Taoist says that on the Way, every day something is dropped."
  },
  {
   "slug": "the-mystic-calls-it",
   "t0": 491.09,
   "t1": 498.682,
   "say": 6.622,
   "need": 6.45,
   "sec": 8,
   "text": "The mystic calls it the dark night of the soul, and the dawn after it."
  },
  {
   "slug": "and-if-none-of",
   "t0": 498.802,
   "t1": 505.938,
   "say": 6.198,
   "need": 6.1,
   "sec": 8,
   "text": "And if none of those words are yours, here is what it also is."
  },
  {
   "slug": "a-pattern-observed-traced",
   "t0": 506.058,
   "t1": 518.197,
   "say": 10.858,
   "need": 9.95,
   "sec": 8,
   "text": "A pattern, observed. Traced to where it began. Found in my own body. Followed down my own bloodline. Until the signal showed beneath the noise."
  },
  {
   "slug": "it-does-not-need",
   "t0": 518.317,
   "t1": 524.597,
   "say": 4.08,
   "need": 4.35,
   "sec": 8,
   "text": "It does not need your belief. Only your attention."
  },
  {
   "slug": "if-you-call-it",
   "t0": 525.3,
   "t1": 529.124,
   "say": 3.13,
   "need": 3.65,
   "sec": 9,
   "text": "If you call it awakening, you’re right."
  },
  {
   "slug": "if-you-call-it",
   "t0": 529.244,
   "t1": 533.069,
   "say": 3.13,
   "need": 3.65,
   "sec": 9,
   "text": "If you call it enlightenment, you’re right."
  },
  {
   "slug": "if-you-call-it",
   "t0": 533.189,
   "t1": 538.335,
   "say": 4.361,
   "need": 4.7,
   "sec": 9,
   "text": "If you call it the end of illusion, you’re right."
  },
  {
   "slug": "if-you-call-it",
   "t0": 538.455,
   "t1": 542.279,
   "say": 3.13,
   "need": 3.65,
   "sec": 9,
   "text": "If you call it healing, you’re right."
  },
  {
   "slug": "if-you-call-it",
   "t0": 542.399,
   "t1": 546.223,
   "say": 3.13,
   "need": 3.65,
   "sec": 9,
   "text": "If you call it deprogramming, you’re right."
  },
  {
   "slug": "if-you-call-it",
   "t0": 546.343,
   "t1": 550.168,
   "say": 3.13,
   "need": 3.65,
   "sec": 9,
   "text": "If you call it liberation, you’re right."
  },
  {
   "slug": "if-you-call-it",
   "t0": 550.288,
   "t1": 556.755,
   "say": 5.592,
   "need": 5.75,
   "sec": 9,
   "text": "If you call it finally seeing clearly for the first time, you’re right."
  },
  {
   "slug": "the-words-are-different",
   "t0": 556.875,
   "t1": 563.026,
   "say": 3.951,
   "need": 4.35,
   "sec": 9,
   "text": "The words are different. The destination is the same."
  },
  {
   "slug": "notice-what-i-did",
   "t0": 563.7,
   "t1": 567.647,
   "say": 3.157,
   "need": 3.3,
   "sec": 10,
   "text": "Notice what I did not do."
  },
  {
   "slug": "i-did-not-rise",
   "t0": 567.767,
   "t1": 577.849,
   "say": 8.871,
   "need": 7.5,
   "sec": 10,
   "text": "I did not rise above the earth. I did not ascend. I did not leave my body behind."
  },
  {
   "slug": "i-descended-down-through",
   "t0": 577.969,
   "t1": 583.449,
   "say": 4.586,
   "need": 4.35,
   "sec": 10,
   "text": "I descended. Down through everything, into my own core."
  },
  {
   "slug": "the-sun-did-not",
   "t0": 583.569,
   "t1": 587.005,
   "say": 2.681,
   "need": 2.95,
   "sec": 10,
   "text": "The sun did not appear."
  },
  {
   "slug": "it-was-never-gone",
   "t0": 587.125,
   "t1": 590.05,
   "say": 2.205,
   "need": 2.6,
   "sec": 10,
   "text": "It was never gone."
  },
  {
   "slug": "i-only-moved-what",
   "t0": 590.17,
   "t1": 600.763,
   "say": 9.348,
   "need": 7.85,
   "sec": 10,
   "text": "I only moved what had been stacked against the window, one block at a time, and let it through."
  },
  {
   "slug": "my-original-frequency",
   "t0": 600.883,
   "t1": 603.296,
   "say": 1.729,
   "need": 2.25,
   "sec": 10,
   "text": "My original frequency."
  },
  {
   "slug": "who-i-am-underneath",
   "t0": 603.416,
   "t1": 607.875,
   "say": 3.633,
   "need": 3.65,
   "sec": 10,
   "text": "Who I am, underneath all of it."
  },
  {
   "slug": "pulsing-quietly-waiting",
   "t0": 607.995,
   "t1": 611.924,
   "say": 1.729,
   "need": 2.25,
   "sec": 10,
   "text": "Pulsing. Quietly. Waiting."
  },
  {
   "slug": "i-came-back-up",
   "t0": 614.9,
   "t1": 619.358,
   "say": 3.633,
   "need": 3.65,
   "sec": 11,
   "text": "I came back up with a map."
  },
  {
   "slug": "the-first-fractal-helped",
   "t0": 619.478,
   "t1": 623.425,
   "say": 3.157,
   "need": 3.3,
   "sec": 11,
   "text": "The first Fractal helped people see."
  },
  {
   "slug": "this-one-completes-the",
   "t0": 623.545,
   "t1": 626.981,
   "say": 2.681,
   "need": 2.95,
   "sec": 11,
   "text": "This one completes the map."
  },
  {
   "slug": "every-technique-opened-to",
   "t0": 627.101,
   "t1": 636.16,
   "say": 7.919,
   "need": 6.8,
   "sec": 11,
   "text": "Every technique, opened to show the tactics inside it. Three hundred thirty-five in a single sector."
  },
  {
   "slug": "and-the-thing-i",
   "t0": 636.28,
   "t1": 643.295,
   "say": 6.014,
   "need": 5.4,
   "sec": 11,
   "text": "And the thing I most needed someone to show me. The combinations."
  },
  {
   "slug": "no-one-is-undone",
   "t0": 643.415,
   "t1": 648.384,
   "say": 4.11,
   "need": 4.0,
   "sec": 11,
   "text": "No one is undone by a single move."
  },
  {
   "slug": "the-moves-come-in",
   "t0": 648.504,
   "t1": 656.541,
   "say": 6.967,
   "need": 6.1,
   "sec": 11,
   "text": "The moves come in order, each one taking away the defense against the next."
  },
  {
   "slug": "two-hundred-and-three",
   "t0": 656.661,
   "t1": 667.254,
   "say": 9.348,
   "need": 7.85,
   "sec": 11,
   "text": "Two hundred and three of them have names now. The Debt Prison. The Golden Cage. The Trauma Bond Engine."
  },
  {
   "slug": "they-are-the-map",
   "t0": 667.374,
   "t1": 675.921,
   "say": 7.443,
   "need": 6.45,
   "sec": 11,
   "text": "They are the map of how this cycle has marked every life it has touched."
  },
  {
   "slug": "and-read-in-order",
   "t0": 676.041,
   "t1": 686.634,
   "say": 9.348,
   "need": 7.85,
   "sec": 11,
   "text": "And read in order, they are the outline for seeing a chain, and breaking it, wherever you meet it."
  },
  {
   "slug": "my-healing-journey-involved",
   "t0": 686.754,
   "t1": 696.835,
   "say": 8.871,
   "need": 7.5,
   "sec": 11,
   "text": "My healing journey involved forgiving the people who tried to destroy my mind and my heart for money."
  },
  {
   "slug": "justice-comes-from-breaking",
   "t0": 696.955,
   "t1": 730.74,
   "say": 32.205,
   "need": 24.65,
   "sec": 11,
   "text": "Justice comes from breaking every tool they have, so that none of them ever works on anyone again by the time I am done. And from letting the truth of who they are be seen by everyone they care about. Not by exposing them myself. By exposing their tactics to the entire world, so they can never again hide in the shadows and think they are safe."
  },
  {
   "slug": "it-will-take-me",
   "t0": 730.86,
   "t1": 735.83,
   "say": 4.11,
   "need": 4.0,
   "sec": 11,
   "text": "It will take me a lifetime to finish."
  },
  {
   "slug": "i-am-giving-it",
   "t0": 735.95,
   "t1": 739.386,
   "say": 2.681,
   "need": 2.95,
   "sec": 11,
   "text": "I am giving it away."
  },
  {
   "slug": "to-everyone-wherever-this",
   "t0": 739.506,
   "t1": 743.453,
   "say": 3.157,
   "need": 3.3,
   "sec": 11,
   "text": "To everyone. Wherever this cycle runs."
  },
  {
   "slug": "it-started-with-a",
   "t0": 743.573,
   "t1": 747.009,
   "say": 2.681,
   "need": 2.95,
   "sec": 11,
   "text": "It started with a question."
  },
  {
   "slug": "now-the-map-is",
   "t0": 747.129,
   "t1": 752.01,
   "say": 2.681,
   "need": 2.95,
   "sec": 11,
   "text": "Now the map is yours."
  }
